SubLingo packages and uses third-party open-source software. The generated
release dependency inventory is stored in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and
sbom/sublingo-release.cdx.json.

Important bundled/runtime components include:

- youtubedl-android and yt-dlp (GPL-3.0 family; verify upstream notices for
  the exact packaged version before every public distribution)
- FFmpeg and aria2c runtime packages supplied by youtubedl-android
- AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, Media3, Room, WorkManager, Hilt, OkHttp,
  Retrofit, Kotlin, kotlinx.serialization, Coil, and Material Components
- The bundled basic English-Chinese dictionary derived from ECDICT; ECDICT
  is distributed under the MIT License according to its upstream project

This file is an engineering inventory, not legal advice. A distributor must
